OL,3,GNEWSAWoman escapes with minor injuries
OL,4,Aas car hit by train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was taken to hospital with
OL,7,Fminor injuries after a car was hit by a
OL,8,Ffreight train on a level crossing in
OL,9,FLeicestershire.
OL,11,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said it
OL,12,Fwas called to the crossing in Rearsby
OL,13,Fat about 20:35 BST on Tuesday.
OL,15,FNetwork Rail said the vehicle had
OL,16,Fbecome "stranded" at the crossing, and
OL,17,Fthat the driver had got out of the car
OL,18,Fbefore the crash.
OL,20,FA BTP spokesperson said the woman was
OL,21,Fthe only person in the vehicle, and she
OL,22,Fwas taken to hospital to be assessed.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
